<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 4.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 4.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Wednesday, June 4:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,603.60 (1,571.30)	CHF  1,118.80 (1,098.40)</p>
<p>    DEM    929.30 (911.00)	  GBP  2,622.50 (2,566.10)</p>
<p>    ATS    132.02 (129.56)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Tuesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $8.49 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$9.60 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $18.09 million ($24.90 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
